# Git LFS is NOT used from cloud sessions (the session proxy rejects LFS uploads).
# Keep committed media under 100 MB per file (GitHub limit); keep raw footage outside git
# (see docs/assets-storage.md). On a local machine with LFS available you can enable, e.g.:
#   *.mp4 filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.mp4 binary
*.mov binary
*.wav binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff2 binary
